    "title": "<p class=\"TableTitle\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Table&nbsp;6.01</span></strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\"> Molecular alterations and their prevalence in pilocytic astrocytomas</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableTitle\">&nbsp;</p>",
    "legend": "",
    "source": "",
    "copyright": "Louis DN, Ohgaki H, Wiestler OD, et al., editors. WHO classification of tumours of the central nervous system. Lyon (France): International Agency for Research on Cancer; 2016. (WHO classification of tumours series, 4th rev. ed.; vol. 1). https://publications.iarc.fr/543.\r\nand\r\nAdapted from: Collins VP, Jones DT, Giannini C. Pilocytic astrocytoma: pathology, molecular mechanisms and markers. Acta Neuropathol. 2015 Jun;129(6):775–88. PMID:25792358",
    "tablehtml": "<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"width: 24cm; border-collapse: collapse;\" border=\"0\" width=\"907\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 163.05pt; background: #8db3e2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"217\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Genetic alteration</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 85.35pt; background: #8db3e2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"114\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">% of tumours</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 245pt; background: #8db3e2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"327\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Prevalence</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 187pt; background: #8db3e2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"249\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">References</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 163.05pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"217\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><em><span lang=\"EN-GB\">KIAA1549</span></em><span lang=\"EN-GB\">::<em>BRAF</em> fusion</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 85.35pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"114\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&gt;&nbsp;60%</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 245pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"327\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Common, particularly cerebellar; rare in other tumour forms except diffuse leptomeningeal glioneuronal tumour</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 187pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"249\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span class=\"Ref-ID\" style=\"color: windowtext; border: none;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">{18974108;19016743}</span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 163.05pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"217\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Other <em>BRAF</em> fusions</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 85.35pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"114\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&lt;&nbsp;5%</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 245pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"327\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Occasional; very rare in other entities</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 187pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"249\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span class=\"Ref-ID\" style=\"color: windowtext; border: none;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">{29141672}</span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 163.05pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"217\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><em><span lang=\"EN-GB\">BRAF</span></em><span lang=\"EN-GB\"> mutations (especially p.V600E)</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 85.35pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"114\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">~5&ndash;10%</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 245pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"327\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Occasional, mainly supratentorial; also in many other glial and glioneuronal tumours</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 187pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"249\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span class=\"Ref-ID\" style=\"color: windowtext; border: none;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">{21274720;19363522}</span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 163.05pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"217\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><em><span lang=\"EN-GB\">NF1</span></em><span lang=\"EN-GB\"> mutation</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 85.35pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"114\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">~10&ndash;15%</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 245pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"327\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Typically germline; common with optic pathway tumours</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 187pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"249\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span class=\"Ref-ID\" style=\"color: windowtext; border: none;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">{10931370;23222849}</span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 163.05pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"217\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><em><span lang=\"EN-GB\">FGFR1</span></em><span lang=\"EN-GB\"> mutation</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 85.35pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"114\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&lt;&nbsp;5%</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 245pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"327\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Found mainly in midline tumours; also observed in other low-grade gliomas</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 187pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"249\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span class=\"Ref-ID\" style=\"color: windowtext; border: none;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">{23817572;31673897;31729570}</span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 163.05pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"217\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><em><span lang=\"EN-GB\">FGFR1</span></em><span lang=\"EN-GB\"> fusions (especially <em>FGFR1</em>::<em>TACC1</em>)</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 85.35pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"114\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&lt;&nbsp;5%</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 245pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"327\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><em><span lang=\"EN-GB\">FGFR1</span></em><span lang=\"EN-GB\">::<em>TACC1</em> fusion more common; also observed in other low-grade gliomas</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 187pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"249\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span class=\"Ref-ID\" style=\"color: windowtext; border: none;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">{23817572;31729570}</span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 163.05pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"217\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">NTRK family fusions</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 85.35pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"114\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">~2%</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 245pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"327\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Rare; also observed in other glial/glioneuronal tumours</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 187pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"249\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span class=\"Ref-ID\" style=\"color: windowtext; border: none;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">{23817572;32082673}</span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 163.05pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"217\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><em><span lang=\"EN-GB\">KRAS</span></em><span lang=\"EN-GB\"> mutation</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 85.35pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"114\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Single cases</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 245pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"327\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Very rare in pilocytic astrocytoma; extremely rare in other entities</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 187pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"249\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span class=\"Ref-ID\" style=\"color: windowtext; border: none;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">{16247081;17712732}</span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid; height: 2.9pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 163.05pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt; height: 2.9pt;\" width=\"217\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><em><span lang=\"EN-GB\">RAF1</span></em><span lang=\"EN-GB\"> fusion</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 85.35pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt; height: 2.9pt;\" width=\"114\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Single cases</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 245pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt; height: 2.9pt;\" width=\"327\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Very rare in pilocytic astrocytoma; extremely rare in other entities (with the possible exception of pleomorphic xanthoastrocytoma)</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 187pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt; height: 2.9pt;\" width=\"249\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span class=\"Ref-ID\" style=\"color: windowtext; border: none;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">{19363522;19373855;27810072}</span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 163.05pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"217\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><em><span lang=\"EN-GB\">ROS1</span></em><span lang=\"EN-GB\"> fusions</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 85.35pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"114\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Single cases</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 245pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"327\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Very rare in pilocytic astrocytoma; more common in infantile hemispheric glioma; extremely rare in other entities</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 187pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"249\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span class=\"Ref-ID\" style=\"color: windowtext; border: none;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">{31626289;32289278}</span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 163.05pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"217\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Other alterations (of <em>MET</em>, <em>RET</em>, etc.)</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 85.35pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"114\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Single cases</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 245pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"327\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Very rare in pilocytic astrocytoma; frequency in other entities not determined (probably extremely rare)</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 187pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"249\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span class=\"Ref-ID\" style=\"color: windowtext; border: none;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">{32289278}</span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>",
